  day: 3
  text: "\u2018Ello man! Hope things are doing well for ya! Say have you met Elsa
    yet? My she\u2019s a pretty one. Most folk around here thinks her machinery off-putting.
    Not me though, that stuff's sexy! Rumor has it she\u2019s a part of the Steelhearts.
    But I don\u2019t think so. Don\u2019t think she got it in her to kill innocents
    in some delusional quest of faith. I heard she wanted to be sent to B1 today,
    mind sending me there too?"
